# Monstrosity (otherAreas 34): both guards xi.settings.main.ENABLE_MONSTROSITY == 1 (available and accepted) with the
# setting a boolean: Lua's `true == 1` is false (Settings.MainEquals, quest rework P9; MainNumber / Main would read true as
# 1). Pashhow Marshlands' Suspicious Hume (his script does nothing until completed). Available, true: no section, nothing.
# 1: 40, finished: begun. Accepted, true: no section, nothing (a port reading true as 1 would play 41). 1: 41.
# ENABLE_SOA / ENABLE_ROV 0 as in the main flow. Recorded on Lua at 6c38eff5^ (the parent of the commit that deleted the
# Lua).
lists PashhowMarshlands/Suspicious_Hume/onTrigger PashhowMarshlands/onEventFinish/40
char zone=PashhowMarshlands pos=-490.3,25,-618.6 job=WAR lvl=75
setting ENABLE_MONSTROSITY true
setting ENABLE_SOA 0
setting ENABLE_ROV 0
login
trigger Suspicious_Hume                 # available, true: no section; nothing
setting ENABLE_MONSTROSITY 1
trigger Suspicious_Hume                 # available, 1: 40
finish                                  # begun
setting ENABLE_MONSTROSITY true
trigger Suspicious_Hume                 # accepted, true: no section; nothing
setting ENABLE_MONSTROSITY 1
trigger Suspicious_Hume                 # accepted, 1, no ring: 41
finish
